t propped on an old log. Her yellow-blonde hair, towering a good six inches over her petite frame, is bright against the gray boards of the one-bedroom cabin where her parents raised 12 children in the Smoky Mountains of Tennessee. She is strumming a guitar that is probably worth more than anything inside the little home, which had neither electricity nor running water. By the time the picture was taken in 1987, she had long-since been a global superstar, starred alongside Hollywood legends, and opened her own theme park. But on that porch, she is home, looking dreamily at the horizon. Every rhinestone and diamond feels like it belongs in that humble spot.The postHow Gratitude Defined Dolly Partonappeared first on.", "published_at": "2026-08-30T08:58:47+00:00", "image_url": "https://freebeacon.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/the-weinstein-co-pre-oscar-party-inside-scaled.jpg", "source": {"name": "Washington Free Beacon", "tier": "independent", "url": "https://freebeacon.com"}, "bias_scores": [{"political_lean": 80, "sensationalism": 15, "opinion_fact": 18, "factual_rigor": 40, "framing": 32, "confidence": 0.79, "rationale": {"lean": {"keyword_score": 50.0, "framing_shift": 0.0, "entity_shift": 0.0, "sentence_direction": 0.0, "text_score": 50.0, "source_baseline": 80, "text_shift": 0.0, "delta_max": 10, "confidence": 1.0, "top_left_keywords": [], "top_right_keywords": [], "framing_phrases_found": [], "entity_sentiments": {"fox news": 0.0}, "state_affiliated": false, "unscored": false}, "sensationalism": {"headline_score": 0.0, "body_score": 13.5, "clickbait_signals": 0, "superlative_density": 0.0, "urgency_density": 0.0, "hyperbole_density": 0.0, "measured_density": 0.0, "partisan_attack_density": 0.0}, "opinion": {"pronoun_score": 46.4, "subjectivity_score": 31.3, "modal_score": 0.0, "hedging_score": 0.0, "attribution_score": 45.1, "metadata_score": 0.0, "value_judgment_score": 0.0, "absolutist_assertion_score": 0.0, "classification": "Reporting", "dominant_signals":